        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Beijing</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 1045 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val">The city states of Ji and Yan were given to their rulers by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/king-wu-of-zhou">King Wu of Zhou</a> in the 11th century BCE according to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sima-qian">Sima Qian</a>; the Beijing Government uses 1045 BCE as the official estimate of the date</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Where</span><span class="info-stat-val">On the northern edge of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/north-china-plain">North China Plain</a>, with mountains on three sides, near the Yongding River, in northern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a></span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Known for</span><span class="info-stat-val">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/forbidden-city">Forbidden City</a>; capital under the Jin, Yuan, Ming and Qing; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dadu">Dadu</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kublai-khan">Kublai Khan</a>; the Temple of Heaven; the Legation Quarter; the May Fourth Movement; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tiananmen">Tiananmen</a> Square; the Beijing dialect</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Today</span><span class="info-stat-val">Beijing is the capital of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/peoples-republic-of-china">People's Republic of China</a> and a provincial-level municipality with 16 districts.</span></div>
